# === Reciclaje Litoral AI Exclusion Rules (.aiexclude) ===

# === Submodule & Build Output Artifacts (Token Heavy) ===
**/target/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/cdk.out/
**/.cdk.staging/
**/.aws-sam/
.gradle/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.template.json
cdk.context.json

# === Dependency Folders & Large Lockfiles ===
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock
**/coverage/

# === IDE, Version Control & Tool Metadata ===
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
.qodo/
.gemini/
*.swp
*.swo

# === Environment Variables & Secrets (Allowing .env.example) ===
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# === System Files & Executables ===
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
*.log
